# Generated deploy artifacts, NOT committed.
#
# `public/index.html` is SSR output from generate-page.cljs and
# `public/js/kaigi-app.js` is a shadow-cljs release build. Committing them
# would put a 1.5 MB artifact under review and let it drift from the source it
# was built from — the exact hazard cloud-itonami's shadow-cljs.edn documents
# for its own committed bundle. Deploys run both generators first; the order is
# in README.md under "Build and test".
worker/public/index.html
worker/public/js/
